      "value": "I've noticed that in the vrc_world component, the dynamic materials list sometimes contains materials that I no longer use in the scene, and I'll empty it so that it repopulates correctly next them I build the scene, lowering my upload file size a bit. I haven't really used spawnable objects that much in my project to see if the same thing happens for the dynamic prefabs section. Could this be what you are experiencing?",
